RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SU
SUMMARY:Faith — Play and Pray
LOCATION:Sanctuary
DESCRIPTION:It's time for a gathering with all. Stop by the sanctuary for a
  worship session\, and walk through the corridor to have a glance at the u
 pcoming events — there you'll find a collection.
