DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260728T170000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TU
SUMMARY:Faith — Lectio Bible Study
LOCATION:Small Chapel\, 1st Floor — or on Zoom
DESCRIPTION:Accessible via Zoom: https://us02web.zoom.us/j/7733630505 — If 
 you'd like a quiet place for studying\, visit the small chapel on the firs
 t floor. After completing your studies\, you might want to play some music
  — not the organ\, but something smaller in the chapel.
END:VEVENT
