DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260726T150000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SU
SUMMARY:Giving — Sunday Rice
LOCATION:1st Floor Porter Room
DESCRIPTION:Details: https://www.chicagofirstchurch.org/sunday-rice — Under
  the curly stain on the glass\, there is a box with a passcode. Find what 
 remains unchanged for all our gatherings!
END:VEVENT
