DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260731T210000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=FR
SUMMARY:Creativity — Sanctuary Concert
DESCRIPTION:This is a concert invite without a specific venue. Refer to the
  past cultural events archive (https://drive.google.com/file/d/13cYnlvNiP9
 92l5UvTzpCGj_ohcJJVwVw/view?usp=sharing) and find the venue with the most 
 likelihood. A reward is hidden on stage where the light is always projecte
 d — like it never fades.
END:VEVENT
