  something important was left behind the curtain. Find the wedding referen
 ce in the event list (https://drive.google.com/file/d/13cYnlvNiP992l5UvTzp
 CGj_ohcJJVwVw/view?usp=sharing)\, and investigate where the lost item hide
 s.
